*Envelope Detector with Low-Pass Filter
*- Used to demodulate amplitude-modulated (AM) signals
*- Very cheap and easy to build
R1 env 0 100k
C1 env 0 10n
Eo N002 0 N001 0 8
Bi N001 0 V = (1+0.5*sin(2*pi*1k*time))*sin(2*pi*20k*time)
D1 amp env D1
C2 out 0 15n
R2 env out 10k
Ri N001 0 10k
Ro amp N002 75
.tran 1n 4m 1m
.model D1 D(Vfwd=0.7)
.end
